<view class="pet-page"><bc-top-bar title="今日任务" show-back="{{true}}" bg-color="{{theme.pageStart || '#DDF4FF'}}" theme="{{theme}}" bind:back="onBack" />
<scroll-view scroll-y class="pet-scroll">
  <view class="pet-card"><view class="pet-section-head"><view class="pet-section-title">今天完成 {{completedCount}} / 3</view><view class="pet-chip pet-chip--yellow">自动入账</view></view><view class="pet-progress"><view class="pet-progress__fill" style="{{progressStyle}}"></view></view><view class="pet-muted task-note">任务每天更新，没完成不会扣积分，也不会影响宠物。</view></view>
  <view class="pet-card"><view wx:for="{{tasks}}" wx:key="id" class="task-row {{item.done ? 'is-done' : ''}}" data-path="{{item.path}}" data-done="{{item.done}}" bindtap="goTask"><view class="task-icon">{{item.done ? '✓' : index + 1}}</view><view class="pet-item-main"><view class="pet-item-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="pet-item-meta">{{item.desc}}</view></view><view class="task-reward">{{item.done ? '已完成' : item.reward}}</view></view></view>
  <view class="pet-card"><view class="pet-section-title">奖励规则</view><view class="pet-muted rule-copy">经验只会增加，不会被消费。星星积分只能通过学习、成长任务和合规分享获得，不能充值。宠物不会生病或离开。</view></view>
</scroll-view></view>
